---
import '../styles/global.css';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';

const features = [
  {
    href: '/shuffle/',
    title: 'Cognitive Shuffle',
    description: 'Quiet your racing mind with random words to visualize',
    icon: '🧠',
    accent: 'var(--color-drift-accent)',
  },
  {
    href: '/journal/',
    title: 'Brain Dump',
    description: 'Write it down, lock it away, let it go',
    icon: '📝',
    accent: 'var(--color-drift-success)',
  },
  {
    href: '/breathe/',
    title: 'Guided Breathing',
    description: 'Breathe deeply with calming visual guidance',
    icon: '🌊',
    accent: 'var(--color-drift-orb-exhale)',
  },
  {
    href: '/calm/',
    title: 'Circuit Breaker',
    description: 'Instant calm when anxiety strikes',
    icon: '🛡️',
    accent: 'var(--color-drift-warning)',
    urgent: true,
  },
  {
    href: '/checkin/',
    title: 'Sleep Check-in',
    description: 'Track your rest, see your trends',
    icon: '📊',
    accent: 'var(--color-drift-accent-glow)',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Ways to Fall Asleep Faster" 
  description="Can't fall asleep? Discover proven ways to fall asleep fast. Use cognitive shuffling and breathing exercises to fall asleep in 10 seconds or minutes. Your nightly companion."
>
  <div class="home">
    <header class="home__header">
      <div class="home__moon" aria-hidden="true">🌙</div>
      <h1 class="home__title">Fall Asleep</h1>
      <p class="home__subtitle">Your nightly companion for real rest</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="home__features" aria-label="Sleep tools">
      {features.map((feature) => (
        <a
          href={feature.href}
          class:list={['home__card drift-card', { 'home__card--urgent': feature.urgent }]}
          style={`--card-accent: ${feature.accent}`}
        >
          <span class="home__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">{feature.icon}</span>
          <div class="home__card-content">
            <h2 class="home__card-title">{feature.title}</h2>
            <p class="home__card-desc">{feature.description}</p>
          </div>
          <svg class="home__card-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
        </a>
      ))}
    </nav>

    <footer class="home__footer">
      <p class="home__privacy">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        All data stays on your device. No accounts, no cloud, no tracking.
      </p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <article class="seo-article">
    <div class="seo-article__inner">
      <h2>Can't Fall Asleep? Discover Ways to Fall Asleep Faster</h2>
      <p>If you are lying in bed, staring at the ceiling, and thinking, "I can't fall asleep," you are far from alone. Millions of people struggle with racing thoughts and nighttime anxiety when they should be resting. Finding effective ways to fall asleep is essential for your physical health, mental clarity, and overall well-being. This private, distraction-free tool was designed specifically for those difficult nights, providing a gentle environment to help you fall asleep fast and stay asleep throughout the night.</p>
      
      <h3>Proven Ways to Fall Asleep</h3>
      <p>When traditional methods fail, science-backed relaxation techniques can make all the difference. Our suite of tools focuses on cognitive behavioral techniques designed to calm your nervous system. By shifting your focus away from the stress of being awake, you can discover new ways to fall asleep naturally. Whether it's through guided breathing, grounding exercises, or mental visualization, these methods are tailored to help you fall asleep faster without the need for medications or endless scrolling on social media. Your brain just needs the right signal to power down.</p>
      
      <h3>The Cognitive Shuffle: How to Fall Asleep Faster</h3>
      <p>One of the absolute best ways to fall asleep faster is a technique known as the Cognitive Shuffle (or serial diverse imagining). When we are stressed or anxious, our brains remain engaged in logical, structured thought patterns—the exact opposite of what happens when we sleep. The Cognitive Shuffle works by prompting you to visualize a sequence of random, completely unrelated words or images. This process scrambles your brain's attempt to overthink, closely mimicking the scattered micro-dreams that naturally occur right before you drift off. By giving your brain a meaningless but engaging task, you can bypass anxiety and fall asleep fast.</p>
      
      <h3>Breathing Techniques: Can You Fall Asleep in 10 Seconds?</h3>
      <p>You may have heard claims online that you can fall asleep in 10 seconds using specific military methods or advanced breathing exercises. While achieving deep sleep in exactly ten seconds takes immense practice and ideal physical conditions, the foundational physiological techniques behind these claims—like the famous 4-7-8 breathing method or box breathing—are incredibly powerful and effective. Deep, rhythmic breathing physically slows your heart rate, lowers blood pressure, and signals to your parasympathetic nervous system that it is safe to rest. Our guided breathing tool provides a soothing visual pacing guide to help you master these exact rhythms, helping you get as close as possible to that immediate, deep relaxation. If you are struggling and can't fall asleep, a simple five-minute breathing exercise can dramatically accelerate your transition from stressful wakefulness into deep, restorative rest.</p>
      
      <h3>Your Private Nightly Companion</h3>
      <p>Unlike other applications that aggressively track your data, require account sign-ups, or stimulate your brain with bright screens and notifications, this tool is intentionally built for the dark. Everything stays locally on your device—no accounts, no tracking, and no cloud processing. The deep dark theme, muted accent colors, and ultra-calming animations are carefully crafted to preserve your precious night vision and minimize blue light exposure before bed. When you use this app, you are engaging in a safe, entirely private space designed solely to help you find peace.</p>
      <p>If you are exhausted but your mind simply won't shut down, stop fighting it. Use the Cognitive Shuffle to scramble your racing thoughts, the Brain Dump journal to securely lock away your lingering worries, or the Circuit Breaker to ground yourself in the present moment. Explore these scientifically proven ways to fall asleep, find the unique rhythm that works best for your body, and discover exactly how effortless it can be to fall asleep fast, wake up truly rested, and reclaim your nights.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Navigation slot="nav" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .home {
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem 6rem;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .home__header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .home__moon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255, 200, 50, 0.3));
  }

  .home__title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-drift-text) 0%, var(--color-drift-accent) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .home__subtitle {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-drift-text-muted);
    margin: 0.375rem 0 0;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .home__features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .home__card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    min-height: 72px;
  }

  .home__card--urgent {
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 74, 0.2);
    order: -1;
  }

  .home__card-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--color-drift-surface-raised);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
  }

  .home__card-content {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .home__card-title {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-drift-text);
  }

  .home__card-desc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-drift-text-muted);
    margin: 0.125rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .home__card-arrow {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--color-drift-text-dim);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .home__card:hover .home__card-arrow {
    transform: translateX(2px);
    color: var(--card-accent);
  }

  .home__footer {
    padding-top: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .home__privacy {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--color-drift-text-dim);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .home__card-arrow {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  .seo-article {
    background: var(--color-drift-bg);
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 8rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .seo-article__inner {
    max-width: 42rem; /* ~65 characters wide for comfortable reading */
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--color-drift-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .seo-article__inner h2, .seo-article__inner h3 {
    color: var(--color-drift-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 3rem 0 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .seo-article__inner h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .seo-article__inner h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .seo-article__inner p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
